{
  "$comment": "Native context building. `urls`: nativeContextUrl(bundleId, screen) must produce exactly `url` (app://<bundleId>/<screen>, each route segment percent-encoded, leading slashes dropped). `valid` contexts must be accepted by CaptureContext (contract.json#wire.schemas.CaptureContext) and `invalid` ones rejected. A context with no `source` is web. A native context needs `anchor` and `pin` unless `crashed` is true; a crash report still needs `screen` (the last screen the app reported).",
